{
    "_doc": "The gathering command of Job_Activity (see Plan_ActivityJobs): while an activity job gathers its participants in the gather room, each waiting participant runs this COM there, in a package of their own (ActionPackage_ActivityWait - not joinable; its duration is the job's remaining wait, up to T+30). The player gets the same command as a button (Job_Activity.MakePlayerWaitPackage) that advances time while they wait; joinAlone keeps their target and teammates out of it. When the activity can launch, the job interrupts every waiting package (the player's too - the update loop stops advancing time); one that runs out first is simply issued again.",
    "COMs":
    {
        "list":
        [
            {
                "ID":"recreation_activity_wait",
                "ActionPackageClass":"ActionPackage_ActivityWait",
                "displayName":"recreation_activity_wait_displayName",
                "_comment_timeScale":"fallback only - ActionPackage_ActivityWait takes its duration from the job (Job_Activity.WaitMinutesLeft, up to T+30)",
                "timeScale":30,
                "comTags":["recreation","activity_wait"],
                "requirements": { "requirement": { "treatReceiverAsDoer": true, "joinAlone": true } },
                "variants": [
                    {
                        "requirements": { "requirement": { } },
                        "displayName":"recreation_activity_wait_displayName"
                    }
                ],
                "AcceptanceCheck": { "baseAcceptanceValue": 10 },
                "DifficultyCheck":{ "baseD20Check":0 },
                "description_begin":{ "Entries":[ { "keepLooking":true, "texts":["recreation_activity_wait_begin"] } ] },
                "description_ongoing":{ "Entries":[ { "keepLooking":true, "texts":["recreation_activity_wait_ongoing"] } ] },
                "description_remove":{ "Entries":[ { "keepLooking":true, "texts":["recreation_activity_wait_remove"] } ] },
                "description_after":{ "Entries":[ { "keepLooking":true, "texts":["recreation_activity_wait_after"] } ] }
            }
        ]
    },
